    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated in the heart of the very much sought after Quin village with every local amenity within a short stroll this magnificent four bedroom detached family home set on an incredible site of approximately 0.42 acres offers the ultimate in family living with Quin National School just a short stroll, host of restaurants, bars and convenience store, an abundance of recreational on your doorstep including Dromoland Golf Club, the Rine Leisure Centre, Ballyhannon Stud and so much more. At ground floor level the incredible entrance hallway leads to the open plan kitchen/living/dining, main reception, ground floor WC, bedroom one and utility with three further bedrooms, main bathroom and home office at first floor level. Extensive timber flooring and tiling feature throughout, solid oak fitted kitchen, two oil fired stove and outstanding fixtures and fittings are just some of the many features expressed throughout. The dry stone gated entrance leads to the wraparound tarmacadam drive bound by mature trees, hedgerows and manicured lawns, raised decking and garden shed. Viewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 8.45m x 5m\n(L-Shaped) Centre feature bordered tiled flooring meeting solid oak polished timber, decorative ceiling coving with centre rose feature, wraparound feature staircase leading to first floor landing incorporating indentation for understairs storage, doors leading to ground floor WC, bedroom one, main reception and open plan kitchen/living/dining.\n\nMain Reception - 5.2m x 4.53m\nPolished solid timber flooring, marble surround feature fireplace with marble insert and polished marble flag with overhead marble surround mirror with integrated oil fired stove, wall mounted lighting with further picture lighting, decorative ceiling coving with centre rose feature, recessed lighting and tv point.\n\nOpen plan Kitchen/Living/Dining - 8.85m x 4.83m\nKitchen area solid oak built in wall and base units with ample granite work surfaces with extended splashback to meet tiling to units, eye level glass display units, integrated wine rack, double fan assisted ovens with further integrated appliances including microwave, dishwasher, hob and fridge freezer, ceiling to floor brick surround open fireplace with integrated oil fired range, centre floor island with extended counter to facilitate breakfast seating with additional base storage, recessed ceiling spotlighting, decorative ceiling coving, connecting door to utility and open plan to dining and living. Dining and Living area solid oak timber flooring, recessed ceiling lighting, decorative ceiling coving, tv and broadband connectivity points and double French doors leading to side access.\n\nGround Floor WC - 1.8m x 1.55m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\nBedroom One - 4m x 3.8m\nSolid oak timber flooring, tv point and connecting door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2m x 1.95m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit with integrated lighting, corner fitted shower tray with overhead shower and foldaway glass panel shower door and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 8.55m x 2.66m\nT&G polished wood flooring, decorative ceiling coving, recessed ceiling lighting with connecting doors to walk in hotpress housing immersion tank and shelving, home office and bedrooms two, three and four.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.9m x 3.75m\nT&G polished wood flooring and connecting door to walk in wardrobe.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2m x 2m\nWall to wall ceiling to floor built in units with ample hanging rails and additional overhead storage with T&G polished wood flooring.\n\nBedroom Three - 6m x 4.85m\nT&G polished wood flooring, recessed ceiling lighting, tv and telephone points, connecting doors to walk in wardrobe and ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.5m x 2m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit with integrated lighting, corner fitted shower tray with overhead electric shower with sliding glass panel shower door and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.2m x 2m\nWall to wall ceiling to floor built in units with ample hanging rails and additional overhead storage with T&G polished wood flooring.\n\nBedroom Four - 5.3m x 4.5m\nT&G polished wood flooring and tv and telephone points.\n\nHome Office - 2.9m x 2.9m\nT&G polished wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.6m x 2.95m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror unit with exposed shelving and integrated lighting, tiled panel jacuzzi bath with phone shower attachment and quality bordered ceiling to floor tiling.\n\n"
      },
      {
